["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Causes Stock Market Anomalies? (w/ Victor Haghani) | #429 Merton share extrapolator inelastic demand time series momentum long-short direct indexing Kelly criterion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-rationalreminder-股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者-而是追涨杀跌者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>股市異常波動的元兇不是價值投資者，而是追漲殺跌者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">價值投資者本該壓低波動率，但按固定權重再平衡的「靜態投資者」和根據近期回報調倉的「外推者」合力製造了超額波動、動量這些幾乎所有被反覆討論的市場異象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場異象</span><span class=\"tag\">動量投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why We Never Forget Our Teen Years, with Lisa Damour gawky brain hot and cold reasoning sociometric popularity / perceived popularity reminiscence bump\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-sciencevs-青少年脑子没坏-是刹车比油门慢装上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>青少年腦子沒壞，是剎車比油門慢裝上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">青春期大腦的情緒腦區先升級變快變強，負責理性調控的額葉卻要晚很多年才追上——這種時間差才是情緒劇烈波動的真正原因，不是腦子變差了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期大腦</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everything in Markets Is Now Moving Incredibly Fast TINA breadth negative FCF CDS Minsky moment credit wrap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-oddlots-标普今年近一半的盈利增长-其实就是云厂商的ai资本开支/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>標普今年近一半的盈利增長，其實就是雲廠商的AI資本開支</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛測算，標普今年近一半的盈利增長直接來自雲廠商的AI資本開支，市場押注的不是今天的銷售額，而是三年後這筆錢能不能兌現成收入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">市場寬度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why banks pay you to use their credit cards interchange issuer credit box share of wallet Durbin exemption\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-complexsys-信用卡积分不是银行让利-是商家在替你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7aca5fa32388ea4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>信用卡積分不是銀行讓利，是商家在替你買單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀行向商家收取的刷卡手續費(interchange)才是信用卡真正的利潤引擎，它甚至養活了比航空公司本身更值錢的積分經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">支付</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cuban Missile Crisis Explained DEFCON ExCom Operation Anadyr fait accompli Jupiter missiles\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-01-historyhit-古巴导弹危机不是智斗险胜-而是接近失控的侥幸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>古巴導彈危機不是智鬥險勝，而是接近失控的僥倖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂肯尼迪沉著智鬥赫魯曉夫只是事後美化的「十三天」敘事；真相是一艘缺氧潛艇裡，核魚雷發射與否曾取決於三名軍官的意見分歧和一次偶然的卡殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古巴導彈危機</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Dwarkesh is Wrong about Computer Use + How OpenAI shipped its Jev competitor in 1 Week App Shot TTFT/TTFD mid-turn steering WebSockets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-latentspace-openai-一周内抄出竞品-api-根本没训练新模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdaf8b7fcc00a6ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">39:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一週內抄出競品 API：根本沒訓練新模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">決策 API 的誕生是看到對手產品爆火後的應激反應，OpenAI 一週內就做出競品，秘訣是直接在現有 Luna 模型上加結構化輸出和批量並行推理，根本沒訓練新模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">Agents API</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jake Paul &amp; The Chainsmokers: Turning Fame into Funds, Jake Enters Politics? &amp; Venture Bubble Signs DPI/IRR sixth man NIL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-allin-同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化-这就是泡沫信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d5eab23b851d465-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>同一輪裡估值翻倍卻沒有基本面變化，這就是泡沫信號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">後輪買家願為同一家公司多付兩三倍溢價、公司基本面卻毫無變化——The Chainsmokers 的 Drew Taggart 說，這正是當下該留意的泡沫市場行為信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">名人投資人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, a Year in Stealth and $20M to Replace Slack | Sara Du, Ando MCP thinking traces nerd sniping PMF RFC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-solofounders-单人创始人没想清楚要做什么-先融了2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88fe752a22f867ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人沒想清楚要做什麼，先融了2000萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她認為 Slack 是為人類建的十五年前的寫字樓，根本裝不下智能體這種新住戶，於是以單人創始人身份，在還沒想清楚具體打法時就融了兩輪共2000萬美元去重建一個消息平臺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Fry Quaker / Society of Friends Newgate Prison minister(Quaker title) Jails Act 1823\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-stuffmissed-被讥讽为-监狱游客-的贵格会主妇-推动了英国首部监狱法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>被譏諷為「監獄遊客」的貴格會主婦，推動了英國首部監獄法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">議員們攻擊她沒有法律背景，說她只是監獄裡的「遊客」,但正是她走訪歐洲各地寫下的報告和遊說，促成了1823年監獄法案的通過。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監獄改革</span><span class=\"tag\">貴格會</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At the Money: The Data Behind America&#x27;s Wealthy pass-through business centimillionaire ExecuComp non-compete\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-mastersinbiz-福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3-却拿走一半财富报道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf120ae12f936e3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">13:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>福布斯400佔全美家庭財富僅3%,卻拿走一半財富報道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正撐起美國財富版圖的，是150萬名身價2500萬美元以上、從不上福布斯400的私營企業主，而非聚光燈下的400個人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">遺產稅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Spain, Europe, and the Future of Work flexicurity cupo strong bundle / weak bundle Jevons effect second mover strategy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-tyler-ai真正威胁的不是新工作-而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9fc6f5cb42ffd4f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正威脅的不是新工作，而是十年前外包給印度的乾淨工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邊界清晰、可驗證、單一任務的工作早已被外包到印度，現在輪到AI接手；真正能抵抗AI的，是需要人際關係與政治斡旋的凌亂工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">西班牙政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">歐盟一體化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $1 Trillion AI Buildout | State of Markets Jevons paradox J-curve ACV GMV smiling retention curve\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-a16z-云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元-但ai真实采用率仅2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>雲廠商資本開支衝向萬億美元，但AI真實採用率僅2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">標普500公司AI部署率已達69%,但用長期跟蹤指標衡量的實際影響僅為2%,說明這輪萬億美元級擴張才剛剛開始，遠未到收穫期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI採用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silification Geology (OPALS) with Patrice Rey potch opal opaline silica hydrophane native title doublet/triplet opal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-ologies-破解蛋白石成因用了十年-关键线索来自火星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>破解蛋白石成因用了十年，關鍵線索來自火星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中央澳大利亞的古內海從未沉積石灰巖，酸性風化把火山岩變成硅膠——這套機制先在火星的蛋白石礦物裡被驗證，才反推出歐泊成因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地質學</span><span class=\"tag\">寶石學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does the UK really have nine out of the ten poorest regions in Northern Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) GDP per head household disposable income telomere\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-moreorless-英国-十大最穷地区占九席-换个收入指标就只剩两席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>英國「十大最窮地區佔九席」換個收入指標就只剩兩席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用人均GDP衡量，英國確實佔了北歐十大最窮地區的九席；換成家庭可支配收入這個更貼近生活水平的指標，這個數字立刻掉到兩席。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">統計口徑</span><span class=\"tag\">地區差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500b Melissa Lane on Herotodus and Thucydides historia autopsy nomos-physis debate rhetoric of anti-rhetoric Constitution of the Five Thousand\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-hopwag-那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话-被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>那場雅典逼弱國就範的對話，被社區組織者讀出了求生課而非霸權論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修昔底德讓雅典人對米洛斯人說：正義只在實力相當的雙方之間才談得上，弱者的籌碼只剩「希望」；一群美國社區組織者讀到這段，覺得雅典人說得在理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘史學</span><span class=\"tag\">修昔底德</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E254｜超級厄爾尼諾來了，我們的日常所需真會因它漲價嗎？ ONI IOD ENSO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-sv101-厄尔尼诺不是全球涨价按钮-真正决定价格的是产区集中度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>厄爾尼諾不是全球漲價按鈕：真正決定價格的是產區集中度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同樣遭遇乾旱，集中在兩三個國家的棕櫚油、大豆價格應聲大漲，產區分散的水稻、小麥卻幾乎無感——厄爾尼諾傷不傷得到你的錢包，取決於貿易集中度而非氣候本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span><span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Golden Goose Awards 2026: The Science Behind the Winners (Part 1) (EP 59) Histotripsy Cavitation Duty cycle Jamming Black Marble algorithm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-fromfirstprinc-把肿瘤震碎而非烧掉-免疫系统才能认出残骸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>把腫瘤震碎而非燒掉，免疫系統才能認出殘骸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聲波把腫瘤震碎而非燒化，細胞碎片留住腫瘤抗原，讓免疫系統學會識別並抑制身體其他部位的轉移灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療器械</span><span class=\"tag\">精準醫學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Will AI take power — or will humans use it to take power first? With Katja Grace and Tom Davidson model spec warning shot intent alignment hedonium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-eightythousand-人类独裁者掌权-结果可能比失控ai更糟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8483b66a7194429e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>人類獨裁者掌權，結果可能比失控AI更糟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">湯姆認為單個人類掌握絕對權力後，大概率會像歷史上的暴君一樣把某種狹隘價值鎖定為終局，而受過倫理訓練的AI在對齊的情況下反而更可能保持開放和反思。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frank Furedi on the Case for Populism paradox of tolerance anti-pluralism spirit of populism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-goodfight-反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍异见的人-民粹主义辩护者说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍異見的人——民粹主義辯護者說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的論據是：歐爾班執政十六年零封禁政黨、零驅散示威；反倒是布魯塞爾一場討論「保守派女性主義」的學術會議，被 Antifa 逼到要出動水炮才能開完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span><span class=\"tag\">民主理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Personal Agent Race Is Here | Anish Acharya &amp; David Pawlan narrow startups presumptuousness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-a16z-个人智能体真正的护城河不是人设-是敢替用户做主/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>個人智能體真正的護城河不是人設，是敢替用戶做主</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人格設定幾句話就能改，談不上壁壘；真正難複製的是主動性——智能體敢在多大程度上不經請示就替用戶把事辦了，這條線一旦越界會瞬間失去用戶信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">消費級AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Ackman: The Biggest Fight of His Life AVM (arterial venous malformation) MPC (master planned community) float\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-knowledge-医生通常脑压迫超5小时就放弃手术-她被压了19小时才做手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fce4e1a559b6e3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>醫生通常腦壓迫超5小時就放棄手術，她被壓了19小時才做手術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿克曼說醫生通常在腦內出血壓迫超過5小時後判定腦死亡而放棄手術，女兒被壓迫19小時，他仍要求醫生盡全力手術，如今她認知和幽默感基本恢復，語言、視力與行走仍在艱難恢復中。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投資哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">AI顛覆風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The neuroscience of resonance: How to use language to strengthen attachment with your child with Sarah Peyton resonance earned secure attachment vagus nerve alarmed aloneness Panksepp&#x27;s core emotion circuits nonviolent communication (NVC)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-secureattach-共情可以沉默-共鸣却必须开口确认/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">59:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>共情可以沉默，共鳴卻必須開口確認</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">共情是你獨自對孩子產生的感受，可以完全不說話；共鳴卻必須靠語氣和猜測反覆確認「我懂你嗎」，孩子說「不對」時，兩個人才算真正對上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">非暴力溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 223 ALS: Unraveling the mystery TDP-43 C9ORF72 penetrance bulbar onset / spinal onset upper motor neuron / lower motor neuron ALS Untangled\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-tpwky-冰桶挑战筹了2-2亿美元-als依然没有能治愈的药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>冰桶挑戰籌了2.2億美元，ALS依然沒有能治癒的藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年那場冰桶挑戰讓近3000萬人捐款2.2億美元，但十多年後，唯一被廣泛批准的藥物利魯唑也只能把生存期平均延長三個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ALS</span><span class=\"tag\">漸凍症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"291: How Your Kid’s Exclusion Hurts You Too | Michelle Icard free-floating atom bellying up to the buffet\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-asklisa-孩子被朋友圈排挤-家长插手撮合反而把路堵死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42f1705a647f9db2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友圈排擠，家長插手撮合反而把路堵死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當孩子被朋友圈排除在外時，家長想替她說和、找對方家長理論往往幫倒忙，更該做的是把自己的憤怒放到安全的地方，再問孩子想怎樣應對。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期教育</span><span class=\"tag\">社交排擠</span>\n</div></div></a>"]